# nr-office-ooxml-xlsx-drawings-snapshot: integration fragment

Three modules of the crate mixdog-ooxml (native/core/crates/mixdog-ooxml): xlsx_drawings (the picture and chart-frame anchors on
a worksheet's drawing: frame_anchor_xml, count_drawing_anchors, add_worksheet_image, set_worksheet_drawing,
delete_worksheet_drawing), snapshot_xlsx (the workbook read model: snapshot_xlsx, worksheet_validations, FULL_READ_CELL_LIMIT) and
sheet_audits (protected_input_issues, column_fit_issues, formula_consistency_issues, cell_ink_issues). No protocol method, service
or SERVICE_PENDING name belongs to them, and no new dependency edge: everything they use is already a dependency of the crate.

## native/core/crates/mixdog-ooxml/src/lib.rs

After `pub mod pivot;` (the last module line), add:

    pub mod xlsx_drawings;
    pub mod snapshot_xlsx;
    pub mod sheet_audits;

(and, in the module list of the crate documentation, they are the Node files portable-xlsx-drawings.mjs,
portable-snapshot-xlsx.mjs and portable-sheet-audits.mjs.)

## native/core/fixtures/MANIFEST.json

In the "sets" list, after the entry of office-xlsx-contract (keep the list sorted by set name), add:

    {
      "command": "node benchmarks/rust-core/recorders/record-office-xlsx-drawings-snapshot.mjs --tree <tree>",
      "fileCount": 1,
      "manifest": "office-xlsx-drawings-snapshot/MANIFEST.json",
      "manifestSha256": "0169b9b9528021ac1e59e305a4aa4b04a8ba98fed0df35b0c01c480ff2556404",
      "recorder": "benchmarks/rust-core/recorders/record-office-xlsx-drawings-snapshot.mjs",
      "set": "office-xlsx-drawings-snapshot",
      "totalBytes": 1758662
    }

(Recompute manifestSha256 and totalBytes from the committed MANIFEST.json and golden.json if the tool that keeps this file
reformats them.)

## Not compiled

Written without cargo (the wave is compiled by the lead). The first build of mixdog-ooxml and
`cargo test -p mixdog-ooxml --test twin_xlsx_drawings_snapshot` is the check; the twin test replays the recording and needs no
Node (twin_live_xlsx_drawings_snapshot, ignored, re-records through Node).
